    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This well-located two-bedroom end of terraced home is situated in Garavogue Villas, an established residential area within easy reach of the town centre, schools, shops and all amenities in Sligo. Entering the house, you are welcomed into the sitting room to the front of the house, finished with carpet flooring, decorative coving and a ceiling rose. An electric fireplace creates a cozy focal point, and the room is well set up for modern living with a TV point. Moving through, the living room offers a comfortable second reception space, featuring a gas fireplace with a timber surround and another ceiling rose, making it ideal for relaxing or entertaining. From here, the kitchen is accessed to the rear of the property. The kitchen is fitted with ample units, laminate wood flooring and tiled splash backs, with coving to the ceiling adding a neat finish. Just off the kitchen is a practical utility area with linoleum flooring, providing additional storage and work space. The ground floor bathroom is fully tiled from floor to ceiling and includes a corner electric shower, heated towel rail and upgraded sanitary ware. Upstairs, there are two double bedrooms, both carpeted. The main bedroom includes built-in wardrobes and a TV point. Outside, the property benefits from a garage, driveway and a large garden area with future potential for a development site, subject to planning permission. Overall the property is well situated within walking distance of Doorly park, Sligo regional sports centre and Sligo Regional Park. It is also nearby all essential amenities, making this an excellent opportunity for owner occupiers and investors alike. To make an enquiry please contact Oates Breheny Group on 071-9140404."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ACCOMMODATION\r\n\r\nGROUND FLOOR\r\n\r\nSitting room (4.93m x 4.78m)\r\nCarpet flooring, Coving and ceiling rose, Electrical fire\r\nplace, TV point.\r\n\r\nLiving room (4.57m x 2.90m)\r\nFeature gas fireplace with timber surround, Ceiling rose,\r\nTV point.\r\n\r\nKitchen (3.82m x 3.51m)\r\nFitted kitchen, Laminate wood floor, Tiled between units,\r\nCoving to ceiling.\r\n\r\nUtility (3.18m x 1.67m)\r\nLinoleum flooring.\r\n\r\nBathroom (2.52m x 1.48m)\r\nTiled floor to ceiling, Corner electric shower, Heated\r\ntowel rail, Upgraded sanitary ware, WC, WHB.\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 (3.13m x 2.93m)\r\nDouble room, Carpet floor, Built in wardrobe, TV point.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (3.90m x 1.93m)\r\nDouble room, Carpet floor.\r\n\r\nOUTSIDE\r\n\r\nGarage (3.70m x 2.34m)\r\nConcrete floor, Storage."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "• Oil fired central heating.\r\n• PVC double glazed windows and doors.\r\n• Understairs storage.\r\n• Generous electrical spec.\r\n• Stira to attic.\r\n• Patio area to front.\r\n• Driveway to front.\r\n• Large rear and side garden.\r\n• Future potential for development site subject to planning permission.\r\n• Conveniently located nearby to all amenities including shops,\r\nrestaurants and schools.\r\n• Within walking distance of Doorly Park, Sligo regional sports centre\r\nand Sligo regional park."
      },
      {
